="“I think the best feature is when you lose eye contact with the dog, to be able to take a quick glimpse at your phone and work out exactly where your dogs are when you lose sight of them.”" data-quote-author="Ben Fogle" data-thumbnail-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,w_112,h_112,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador-frame.jpg"> <div class="ambassador-card__picture js-ambassador-card-picture"> <picture class="ambassador-card__image"> <source type="image/avif" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.webp 3x"/> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="Ben Fogle with dog" data-tractive-lazy-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.jpg"/><noscript><img src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/ben-fogle-ambassador.jpg" alt="Ben Fogle with dog"/></noscript> </picture> <button class="ambassador-card__toggle-button js-ambassador-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show ambassador quote"> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-plus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M8 2.58V13.41" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-minus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="ambassador-card__content"> <p class="ambassador-card__description">Award-winning broadcaster &amp; adventurer</p> <div class="ambassador-card__signature"> <img width="231" height="45" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/ambassadors/fogle-signature.png"/><noscript><img src="/static/images/ambassadors/fogle-signature.png" alt=""/></noscript> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card__quote js-ambassador-quote ambassador-card__quote--amber"> <p class="ambassador-card__quote-text">“I think the best feature is when you lose eye contact with the dog, to be able to take a quick glimpse at your phone and work out exactly where your dogs are when you lose sight of them.”</p> <span class="ambassador-card__quote-author">Ben Fogle</span> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card js-ambassador-card ambassador-card__quote--plum" data-background="ambassador-card__quote--plum" data-quote-text="“Tractive is so much more than just a GPS: it’s my everyday ally. Umy, Minimi and Grisette can enjoy their freedom safely, and I have peace of mind. It’s become essential—I couldn’t do without it!”" data-quote-author="Sandrine Arcizet" data-thumbnail-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,w_112,h_112,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/sandrine-arcizet-ambassado