ound" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-minus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="ambassador-card__content"> <p class="ambassador-card__description">TV presenter &amp; animal welfare advocate</p> <div class="ambassador-card__signature"> <img width="231" height="45" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/ambassadors/arcizet-signature.png"/><noscript><img src="/static/images/ambassadors/arcizet-signature.png" alt=""/></noscript> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card__quote js-ambassador-quote ambassador-card__quote--plum"> <p class="ambassador-card__quote-text">“Tractive is so much more than just a GPS: it’s my everyday ally. Umy, Minimi and Grisette can enjoy their freedom safely, and I have peace of mind. It’s become essential—I couldn’t do without it!”</p> <span class="ambassador-card__quote-author">Sandrine Arcizet</span> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card js-ambassador-card ambassador-card__quote--violet" data-background="ambassador-card__quote--violet" data-quote-text="“Caring for those you love also means knowing where they are. Tractive gives me that peace of mind every day.”" data-quote-author="Dani Rovira" data-thumbnail-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,w_112,h_112,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/dani-rovira-ambassador-frame.jpg"> <div class="ambassador-card__picture js-ambassador-card-picture"> <picture class="ambassador-card__image"> <source type="image/avif" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/dani-rovira-ambassador.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c