 welfare advocate</p> <div class="ambassador-card__signature"> <img width="231" height="45" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/ambassadors/rovira-signature.png"/><noscript><img src="/static/images/ambassadors/rovira-signature.png" alt=""/></noscript> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card__quote js-ambassador-quote ambassador-card__quote--violet"> <p class="ambassador-card__quote-text">“Caring for those you love also means knowing where they are. Tractive gives me that peace of mind every day.”</p> <span class="ambassador-card__quote-author">Dani Rovira</span> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card js-ambassador-card ambassador-card__quote--orange" data-background="ambassador-card__quote--orange" data-quote-text="“I only recommend what I truly believe in. That’s why I trust Tractive: a reliable product that helps protect our four-legged friends.”" data-quote-author="Edoardo Stoppa" data-thumbnail-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,w_112,h_112,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador-frame.jpg"> <div class="ambassador-card__picture js-ambassador-card-picture"> <picture class="ambassador-card__image"> <source type="image/avif" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.webp 3x"/> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="Edoardo Stoppa with dog and Tractive GPS" data-tractive-lazy-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.jpg"/><noscript><img src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/edoardo-stoppa-ambassador.jpg" alt="Edoardo Stoppa with dog and Tractive GPS"/></noscript> </picture> <button class="ambassador-card__toggle-button js-ambassador-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show ambassador quote"> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-plus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M8 2.58V13.41" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-minus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="ambassador-card__content"> <p class="ambassador-card__description">TV host &amp; advocate for pet welfare</p> <div class="ambassador-card__signature"> <img width="231" height="45" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/ambassadors/stoppa-signature.png"/><noscript><img src="/static/images/ambassadors/stoppa-signature.png" alt=""/></noscript> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card__quote js-ambassador-quote ambassador-card__quote--orange"> <p class="ambassador-card__quote-text">“I only recommend what I truly believe in. That’s why I trust Tractive: a reliable product that helps protect our four-legged friends.”</p> <span class="ambassador-card__quote-author">Edoardo Stoppa</span> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card js-ambassador-card ambassador-card__quote--teal" data-background="ambassador-card__quote--teal" data-quote-text="“It’s so important that our animals have the opportunity to feel freedom in a safe environment. With Tractive, we have that extra sense of security by knowing where they are.”" data-quote-author="Anders &amp; Johanna Lind Bagge" data-thumbnail-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,w_112,h_112,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors-frame.jpg"> <div class="ambassador-card__picture js-ambassador-card-picture"> <picture class="ambassador-card__image"> <source type="image/avif" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.webp 3x"/> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="Anders &amp; Johanna Lind Bagge" data-tractive-lazy-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.jpg"/><noscript><img src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/h_480,w_302,c_fill/shop-frontend/pages/shared/ambassadors/bagge-ambassadors.jpg" alt="Anders &amp; Johanna Lind Bagge"/></noscript> </picture> <button class="ambassador-card__toggle-button js-ambassador-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show ambassador quote"> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-plus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M8 2.58V13.41" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> <span class="ambassador-card__icon-minus"> <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M2.59 8H13.42" stroke="#121623" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="ambassador-card__content"> <p class="ambassador-card__description">TV icons &amp; pet welfare advocates</p> <div class="ambassador-card__signature"> <img width="231" height="45" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/ambassadors/bagge-signature.png"/><noscript><img src="/static/images/ambassadors/bagge-signature.png" alt=""/></noscript> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ambassador-card__quote js-ambassador-quote ambassador-card__quote--teal"> <p class="ambassador-card__quote-text">“It’s so important that our animals have the opportunity to feel freedom in a safe environment. With Tractive, we have that extra sense of security by knowing where they are.”</p> <span class="ambassador-card__quote-author">Anders &amp; Johanna Lind Bagge</span> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="ambassador-mobile-panel js-ambassador-mobile-panel"> <div class