cat-launch.jpg" srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/tg7-cat-launch/en/tg7-cat-launch.jpg 767w,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/tg7-cat-launch/en/tg7-cat-launch.jpg 1023w," alt="The new Tractive CAT 6 Mini Trackers in color black, brown and lavender floating on a purple background"/></noscript> </picture> <h2 class="section-indicator new-feature-teaser-card__section-indicator--mobile">New</h2> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__content" slide-up> <h2 class="section-indicator new-feature-teaser-card__section-indicator--not-mobile">New</h2> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__text"> <h3 class="section-headline heading-3">Our Most Cat-Friendly Tracker Yet</h3> <p>The new CAT 6 Mini features smart GPS tracking and even smarter health insights. All in a collar designed for your cat's comfort. </p> <a class="button js-track-on-button-clicked" href="/en/pd/gps-tracker-cat" data-tracking-action="cat_pdp" data-tracking-label="new_feature_content">Shop Now</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </div> <div class="tg6xl-adventure-launch-slot" data-tg6xl-adventure-only> <section class="new-feature-teaser-card"> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__wrapper new-feature-teaser-card__wrapper--with-overlap new-feature-teaser-card__wrapper--background-orange"> <span class="new-feature-teaser-card__trail new-feature-teaser-card__trail--desktop"> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail.svg"><noscript><img src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail.svg" alt=""/></noscript> </span> <span class="new-feature-teaser-card__trail new-feature-teaser-card__trail--tablet"> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail-tablet.svg"><noscript><img src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail-tablet.svg" alt=""/></noscript> </span> <span class="new-feature-teaser-card__trail new-feature-teaser-card__trail--mobile"> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" alt="" data-tractive-lazy-src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail-mobile.svg"><noscript><img src="/static/images/landingpage/new-feature-trail-mobile.svg" alt=""/></noscript> </span> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__content-container new-feature-teaser-card__content-container--product"> <picture> <source type="image/avif" media="(max-width: 767px)" height="260" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/avif" media="(max-width: 1023px)" height="383" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/avif" height="456" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.avif 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 767px)" height="260" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 1023px)" height="383" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" height="456" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.webp 3x"/> <img width="490" height="456" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 767px, 1023px" alt="The new Tractive DOG 6 XL Adventure Tracker in orange color showing on a light orange background" data-tractive-lazy-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg 767w,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg 1023w,"><noscript><img src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_260/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg" srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_383/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg 767w,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_456/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/new-product/tg6-dog-adventure-launch.jpg 1023w," alt="The new Tractive DOG 6 XL Adventure Tracker in orange color showing on a light orange background"/></noscript> </picture> <h2 class="section-indicator new-feature-teaser-card__section-indicator--mobile">New</h2> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__content" slide-up> <h2 class="section-indicator new-feature-teaser-card__section-indicator--not-mobile">New</h2> <div class="new-feature-teaser-card__text"> <h3 class="section-headline heading-3">Better Battery for Your Big Breed</h3> <p>Get peace of mind while you explore with the DOG 6 XL Adventure. Enjoy up to 6 weeks of battery, precise GPS, and smart health insights for every moment.</p> <a class="button js-track-on-button-clicked" href="/en/pd/gps-tracker-dog?edition=xl-adventure-orange" data-tracking-action="dog_adventure_pdp" data-tracking-label="new_feature_content">Shop Now</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </div> <section class="app-teaser content-visibility app-teaser--extended-background"> <div class="app-teaser__background"></div> <div class="app-teaser__container"> <h3 class="app-teaser__headline heading-3" slide-up>Get the Tractive app. <br/>Rated with <span>4.7/5</span> on iOS and Android.</h3> <div class="app-teaser__media"> <div class="app-teaser__phone"> <picture> <source type="image/avif" media="(min-width: 1024px)" height="570" width="280" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_570/shop-fronte