<source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 1024px)" height="386" width="386" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_386/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_386/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_386/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 3x"/> <source type="image/webp" height="335" width="335" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 1x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_2,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 2x,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_3,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.webp 3x"/> <img class="app-teaser__background-image" alt="Dog with GPS tracker and preview of Tractive GPS App" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" height="335" width="335" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 335px, 386px" data-tractive-lazy-src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg" data-tractive-lazy-srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg 335w,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_386/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg 386w"><noscript><img alt="Dog with GPS tracker and preview of Tractive GPS App" src="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_335/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg 335w,https://assets.tractive.com/assets/image/dpr_1,h_386/shop-frontend/pages/landing-page/app-teaser/brown-dog-with-tractive-dog-xl.jpg 386w"/></noscript> </picture> </div> <div class="app-teaser__content" slide-up> <h4 class="heading-4">Easy to use and intuitive</h4> <p class="body-normal">That's what customers love about the Tractive GPS app.</p> <a class="button button--transparent-dark js-track-on-button-clicked" data-tracking-action="app_learn_more" href="/en/pd/gps-tracker-dog#app-features">Get Your Tracker</a> </div> </div> </section> <section id="launch" class="video video--background-darkblue"> <div class="video__text-content"> <h3 class="video__title">Say Hello to the Future of Pet Care</h3> <p class="video__text">We&#39;re raising the game with our new Smart Trackers for cats and big dogs. Get AI-powered health features and the trusted GPS tech that makes us #1. All in a device designed around your pet&#39;s comfort.</p> </div> <div class="video__content"> <div class="video__background"></div> <div class="video__container"> <div class="video__youtube-embed"> <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Wine6slk1Iw?autoplay=1&amp;mute=1&amp;cc_load_policy=1" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen title="Say Hello to the Future of Pet Care" loading="lazy"></iframe> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="tracker-teaser js-tracker-teaser content-visibility js-toggle-section" id="tracker-teaser"> <div class="tracker-teaser__header"> <h3 class="tracker-teaser__headline heading-3">Designed for comfort. <span>Built for safety.</span></h3> <div class="toggle js-toggle"> <div class="toggle--active js-toggle-item js-track-on-button-clicked" role="button" tabindex="0" data-tracker-target-type="0" id="dog" data-tracking-action="product_switcher" data-tracking-label="dog"> <span>Dog</span> </div> <div class="js-toggle-item js-track-on-button-clicked" role="button" tabind