c0.2,1.7,0.7,3.2,1.4,4.4c0.7,1.2,1.8,2.1,3.3,2.7c1.5,0.6,3.4,0.9,6,0.9c1.6,0,3.2,0,4.8-0.1c1.6-0.1,3.2-0.3,4.8-0.7v17.5 c-2.5,0.3-5,0.5-7.3,0.8c-2.4,0.3-4.8,0.4-7.3,0.4c-6,0-10.8-0.6-14.4-1.7c-3.6-1.1-6.5-2.8-8.5-5c-2.1-2.2-3.4-4.9-4.2-8.2 c-0.7-3.3-1.2-7.1-1.3-11.3v-60.5h-17.1V137.7z"/> </g> </g> <g id="Star"> <polygon class="tp-1-cgnfh" points="271.3,98.6 167.7,98.6 135.7,0 103.6,98.6 0,98.5 83.9,159.5 51.8,258 135.7,197.1 219.5,258 187.5,159.5 271.3,98.6 271.3,98.6 271.3,98.6 "/> <polygon class="tp-2-jgzv" points="194.7,181.8 187.5,159.5 135.7,197.1 "/> </g> </svg> <h2 class="heading-2">Rated 'Excellent' by our customers</h2> </div> <div class="trustpilot-widget trustpilot-carousel" data-locale="en" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="5576db350000ff0005800ec6" data-style-height="350px" data-style-width="100%" data-font-family="Poppins" data-theme="light" data-stars="5" data-review-disclaimer="true" data-review-languages="en"> <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/tractive.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trustpilot</a> </div> </div> </div> <section class="faq-1-grid content-visibility"> <h2 class="section-indicator" id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2> <div class="faq-1-grid__wrapper"> <header class="faq-1-grid__header"> <h3 class="section-headline heading-3">Looking for answers? You've come to the right place.</h3> </header> <div class="faq-1-grid__content"> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-1-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="How does Tractive work?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-1-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">How does Tractive work?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-1-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-1-page-collapse-default"> <p>The Tractive GPS tracker determines its location using GPS satellites and reports it via cellular networks (LTE). That's why it has an integrated SIM card that automatically connects to local cell networks. Unlike AirTag or other Bluetooth tracking devices, the Tractive GPS tracker can locate your pet worldwide, as long as there's sufficient cellular coverage.</p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-2-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="Why do I need a subscription and what plans are available?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-2-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">Why do I need a subscription and what plans are available?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-2-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-2-page-collapse-default"> <p>Tractive trackers have a built-in SIM card, like your phone, that uses mobile networks to send you location info. All the fees needed to do that are covered by your subscription. That way, you get to enjoy unlimited range worldwide. You can cancel your subscription at any time. <a href="https://tractive.com/en/c/plans">More information<span class="screen-reader-only"> about subscription plans</span></a></p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-3-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="What&#39;s the difference between Tractive and AirTag?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-3-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">What's the difference between Tractive and AirTag?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-3-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-3-page-collapse-default"> <p>AirTags need to be close to other Apple devices to track objects. If your pet is not within range of an Apple device, an AirTag won’t be able to find them. Tractive uses GPS and LTE technology to provide accurate live location data in all countries where Tractive works. </p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-4-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="What&#39;s the battery life of a Tractive GPS Tracker?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-4-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">What's the battery life of a Tractive GPS Tracker?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-4-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-4-page-collapse-default"> <p data-tg6xl-adventure-fallback="true">Battery life strongly depends on tracker model, coverage, and usage. Setting up Power Saving Zones will give it a significant boost.<br><br>The CAT 6 Mini can be used for up to 7 days without a charge. The DOG 6 tracker can last up to 2 weeks. The DOG 6 XL and XL Adventure will track your buddy for up to 6 weeks and 4 weeks, respectively.</p> <p data-tg6xl-adventure-only>Battery life strongly depends on tracker model, coverage, and usage. Setting up Power Saving Zones will give it a significant boost.<br><br>The CAT 6 Mini can be used for up to 7 days without a charge. The DOG 6 tracker can last up to 2 weeks. The DOG 6 XL and DOG 6 XL Adventure will both track your buddy for up to 6 weeks.</p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-5-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="What&#39;s the range of a Tractive GPS Tracker?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-5-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">What's the range of a Tractive GPS Tracker?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-5-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-5-page-collapse-default"> <p>Unlimited. In fact, you could track your pet even if you're on the other side of the world. Tractive works in 175+ countries where there is 2G and/or LTE (CatM1) cellular coverage from one of our 500+ partners.</p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-6-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="How do I get started?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-6-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">How do I get started?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-6-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-6-page-collapse-default"> <p>After ordering your tracker online, all you need to do is download the app for Android or iOS and pick a subscription plan that fits you best.<br><br>Once your tracker arrives, you can either attach it to your pet’s collar or harness with the included clips (dog trackers) or use the collar-integrated Smart Cat Collar (CAT 6 Mini).<br><br>After activating the device in the app, you can start tracking your buddy to help keep them safe and well around the clock.</p> </div> </article> <article class="collapse accordion js-collapse"> <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="accordion__head js-track-custom-event" id="faq-landing-page-7-page-collapse-button--default" data-tracking-value="Does Tractive diagnose health conditions?" data-tracking-action="faqs" data-tracking-label="faq7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-landing-page-7-page-collapse"> <h3> <span class="accordion__headline faq__headline">Does Tractive diagnose health conditions?</span> </h3> </div> <div class="collapse__content accordion__content js-collapse-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-landing-page-7-page-collapse-button--default" id="faq-landing-page-7-page-collapse-default"> <p>No, Tractive monitors your pet's behaviors and vital signs and if they change from day to day. We alert you to any changes or longer-term trends that might need your attention, but medical advice and diagnosis should always be sought from a veterinarian.</p> </div> </article> </div> <script type="application/ld+json">
          {
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "FAQPage",
            "mainEntity": [
              
          
          
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "How does Tractive work?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "The Tractive GPS tracker determines its location using GPS satellites and reports it via cellular networks (LTE). That's why it has an integrated SIM card that automatically connects to local cell networks. Unlike AirTag or other Bluetooth tracking devices, the Tractive GPS tracker can locate your pet worldwide, as long as there's sufficient cellular coverage."
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Why do I need a subscription and what plans are available?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Tractive trackers have a built-in SIM card, like your phone, that uses mobile networks to send you location info. All the fees needed to do that are covered by your subscription. That way, you get to enjoy unlimited range worldwide. You can cancel your subscription at any time. <a href=\"https:\/\/tractive.com\/en\/c\/plans\">More information<span class=\"screen-reader-only\"> about subscription plans<\/span><\/a>"
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What's the difference between Tractive and AirTag?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "AirTags need to be close to other Apple devices to track objects. If your pet is not within range of an Apple device, an AirTag won\u2019t be able to find them. Tractive uses GPS and LTE technology to provide accurate live location data in all countries where Tractive works.\n"
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What's the battery life of a Tractive GPS Tracker?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Battery life strongly depends on tracker model, coverage, and usage. Setting up Power Saving Zones will give it a significant boost.<br><br>The CAT 6 Mini can be used for up to 7 days without a charge. The DOG 6 tracker can last up to 2 weeks. The DOG 6 XL and XL Adventure will track your buddy for up to 6 weeks and 4 weeks, respectively."
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What's the range of a Tractive GPS Tracker?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Unlimited. In fact, you could track your pet even if you're on the other side of the world. Tractive works in 175+ countries where there is 2G and\/or LTE (CatM1) cellular coverage from one of our 500+ partners."
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "How do I get started?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "After ordering your tracker online, all you need to do is download the app for Android or iOS and pick a subscription plan that fits you best.<br><br>Once your tracker arrives, you can either attach it to your pet\u2019s collar or harness with the included clips (dog trackers) or use the collar-integrated Smart Cat Collar (CAT 6 Mini).<br><br>After activating the device in the app, you can start tracking your buddy to help keep them safe and well around the clock."
                }
            }
            ,
            
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Does Tractive diagnose health conditions?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "No, Tractive monitors your pet's behaviors and vital signs and if they change from day to day. We alert you to any changes or longer-term trends that might need your attention, but medical advice and diagnosis should always be sought from a veterinarian."
                }
            }
            
          
          ]
